@firebaseSuffix = -YOUR-CLOUD-RUN-SUFFIX.a.run.app
@idToken = YOUR_FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN

### First page: limit defaults to 10
GET https://listAdminReferrals{{firebaseSuffix}}
Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}

### Exact referred user ID and AND filters; limit can be 10, 20, 30, 50
GET https://listAdminReferrals{{firebaseSuffix}}?limit=20&referredUid=USER_ID&referreduserType=rider&referralCodeUsed=WELCOME123
Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}

### Next page: retain identical filters and limit; URL-encode the returned cursor
GET https://listAdminReferrals{{firebaseSuffix}}?limit=20&referredUid=USER_ID&referreduserType=rider&referralCodeUsed=WELCOME123&cursor=RETURNED_CURSOR
Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}

### Global summary, independent of list filters
GET https://getAdminReferralSummary{{firebaseSuffix}}
Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}

### Export all riders in the inclusive Lagos date range
GET https://exportAdminReferralsCsv{{firebaseSuffix}}?startDate=2026-10-01&endDate=2026-10-17&referreduserType=rider
Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}
